{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18103670","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18103670","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1810367001:1":{"text":"테페시아.","source_cn":"苔佩希。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21ECC5424A0423A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810367002:1":{"text":"어머... 이게 누구람. 무슨 바람이 불어서 <style=\"highlight\">토란 님의 가장 충성스러운 친위대장</style>이 여기까지 오셨대?","source_cn":"哦……瞧瞧，是哪阵阴风把<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6BA9C9533B33AEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810367003:1":{"text":"어딜 가든 꼭 타고 다니던 그 귀여운 망아지는 어쩌고? 왜, 극장 계단이라도 부숴 먹을까 봐 안 데리고 왔니?","source_cn":"你那匹走到哪都要骑着的可爱马驹呢？为何不带进来，是怕它...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x266DF251E5262B13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810367004:1":{"text":"당장 무대에 올라가 광대 노릇이라도 할 셈이 아니라면, 그런 말투는 집어치우는 게 좋을 거다.","source_cn":"如果你不准备到台上扮小丑，就别用那种口气和我说话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x729C9F0A5816E5A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810367005:0":{"text":"걱정 마. 웃을 줄도 모르는 <style=\"highlight\">그레줄</style>. 토란 님께서 오션 오페라 극장을 서커스단으로 바꾸라 명령하셔도 네 귀여운 망아지에게 공굴리기는 시키지 않을 거란다.","source_cn":"别担心，不苟言笑的<style=highlight>格...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x796B4D94EA383713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810367006:1":{"text":"그래서, 용건은?","source_cn":"所以，拜见余是为了何事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE14977FD58E53C6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810367007:1":{"text":"그분께서 <style=\"highlight\">그레이브본 챔버</style>를 언제 가동할 수 있는지 알고자 하신다.","source_cn":"陛下要知道<style=highlight>亡灵转化器...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF19BE2DD04270725","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810367008:1":{"text":"이미 사람을 보내서 여든일곱 번이나 묻고 가셨는데, 아직도 모자라신가 봐?","source_cn":"陛下已经派人来问过八十七次了，还没问够吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3895CAF9B8120AAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810367009:1":{"text":"대답해라.","source_cn":"回答。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F486829A8D8F753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810367010:1":{"text":"대답은 이전과 같아. 건설 작업은 이미 오래전에 끝났지만, 가동하려면 토란 님께 언급했던 물건이 필요하거든.","source_cn":"余的回答和之前相同：建造工作早已完成，但启动它需要余曾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66017ECEAB4C6E20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810367011:1":{"text":"필요한 물건을 제공하겠다고 이미 약속하셨다.","source_cn":"陛下已经许诺，给你提供启动装置所需的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DE0457A740CF309","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810367012:1":{"text":"그래? 그래서 어디 있는데? 왜 내 눈에는 안 보이지?","source_cn":"是吗？在哪？余怎么没有看见？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5E9DCB2BFA35E18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1810367013:1":{"text":"바로 네 앞에 있다.","source_cn":"就在你面前。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1271B70DB38E5153","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1810367014:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1810367015:1":{"text":"토란 님께서 약속하신 <style=\"highlight\">“절대적으로 충성하는 영혼”</style>이 설마... 너야?","source_cn":"托安陛下许诺的，<style=highlight>“绝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38D5ADE12CE4EE10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810367016:1":{"text":"하하하하! 네 영혼을 영원히 앗아가겠다고 하셨는데 이렇게 태연하게 받아들인 거였어?","source_cn":"哈哈哈，哈哈哈哈！他要永久征用你的灵魂，你就这么坦然接受了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE7A0C3E5CA01AA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1810367017:1":{"text":"나태하고 저열한 영혼은 그분에게 쓰임을 받을 수 없다. 바로 너 같은 멍청이를 두고 하는 말이지.","source_cn":"堕怠低等的灵魂不配被陛下使用——比如你这蠢货。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1C3C48E271F87BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1810367018:1":{"text":"원하는 것은 모두 갖춰졌으니 당장 그레이브본 챔버를 가동해. 그분께서는 더 이상 기다리고 싶어 하지 않으신다.","source_cn":"你要的东西已经齐备，立刻启动亡灵转化器，陛下已经不想再等了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9832B59C27308AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810367019:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1810367020:1":{"text":"할 수 없지... 아무래도 나태하게 보내는 시간은 여기까지인 모양이네.","source_cn":"好吧……看来余这懒惰之人，也不得不打起精神了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67C4245EDBBEB695","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:神秘的亡灵":{"text":"신비한 그레이브본","source":"神秘的亡灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:苔佩希":{"text":"테페시아","source":"苔佩希","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格瑞泽尔勒":{"text":"그레줄","source":"格瑞泽尔勒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":3}}